sed_clause_spans\":[{\"end_byte\":264,\"start_byte\":79},{\"end_byte\":1687,\"start_byte\":1080}],\"role\":\"guarantee\"}]", "refs": []}, {"clause_id": "C34", "quote": "Mandatory requested source-facet specification:\nEvery listed original required guarantee retains the globally requested source delivery: canonical file program.vscore.json, one typed entry solve of arity 1, and all seven closed source properties below.", "refs": ["I1", "O1", "O2", "O3", "O4", "O5", "O6", "O7", "S1"]}, {"clause_id": "C35", "quote": "A mathematical result-existence or equality theorem cannot replace entry identity, purity, input preservation, effect restrictions or exact non-floating-point semantics.", "refs": ["O1", "S1"]}, {"clause_id": "C36", "quote": "For every value_required=true row the source must implement the complete functional formula with universal source implementation refinement, including functional safety properties and invariants.", "refs": ["O1", "O2", "O3", "O4", "O5", "O6", "O7"]}, {"clause_id": "C37", "quote": "Value facets are required by default regardless of category.", "refs": ["O1", "O2", "O3", "O4", "O5", "O6", "O7"]}, {"clause_id": "C38", "quote": "Only the explicitly classified operational IDs below are source-only, retaining their source requirements rather than being replaced by value equalities.", "refs": ["I1", "S1"]}, {"clause_id": "C39", "quote": "Assumptions, exclusions and separate non-vacuity witnesses are not source-policy rows.", "refs": []}, {"clause_id": "C40", "quote": "{\"source_only_operational_ids\":[\"I1\",\"S1\"],\"value_required_default\":true}\n{\"format\":\"verislop.required-source-facets/0.1\",\"obligations\":{\"I1\":{\"arity\":1,\"entry\":\"solve\",\"file\":\"program.vscore.json\",\"properties\":[\"typed_total\",\"deterministic\",\"input_preserved\",\"no_external_io\",\"no_floating_point\",\"pure_data\",\"restricted_runtime_only\"],\"value_required\":false},\"O1\":{\"arity\":1,\"entry\":\"solve\",\"file\":\"program.vscore.json\",\"properties\":[\"typed_total\",\"deterministic\",\"input_preserved\",\"no_external_io\",\"no_floating_point\",\"pure_data\",\"restricted_runtime_only\"],\"value_required\":true},\"O2\":{\"arity\":1,\"entry\":\"solve\",\"file\":\"program.vscore.json\",\"properties\":[\"typed_total\",\"deterministic\",\"input_preserved\",\"no_external_io\",\"no_floating_point\",\"pure_data\",\"restricted_runtime_only\"],\"value_required\":true},\"O3\":{\"arity\":1,\"entry\":\"solve\",\"file\":\"program.vscore.json\",\"properties\":[\"typed_total\",\"deterministic\",\"input_preserved\",\"no_external_io\",\"no_floating_point\",\"pure_data\",\"restricted_runtime_only\"],\"value_required\":true},\"O4\":{\"arity\":1,\"entry\":\"solve\",\"file\":\"program.vscore.json\",\"properties\":[\"typed_total\",\"deterministic\",\"input_preserved\",\"no_external_io\",\"no_floating_point\",\"pure_data\",\"restricted_runtime_only\"],\"value_required\":true},\"O5\":{\"arity\":1,\"entry\":\"solve\",\"file\":\"program.vscore.json\",\"properties\":[\"typed_total\",\"deterministic\",\"input_preserved\",\"no_external_io\",\"no_floating_point\",\"pure_data\",\"restricted_runtime_only\"],\"value_required\":true},\"O6\":{\"arity\":1,\"entry\":\"solve\",\"file\":\"program.vscore.json\",\"properties\":[\"typed_total\",\"deterministic\",\"input_preserved\",\"no_external_io\",\"no_floating_point\",\"pure_data\",\"restricted_runtime_only\"],\"value_required\":true},\"O7\":{\"arity\":1,\"entry\":\"solve\",\"file\":\"program.vscore.json\",\"properties\":[\"typed_total\",\"deterministic\",\"input_preserved\",\"no_external_io\",\"no_floating_point\",\"pure_data\",\"restricted_runtime_only\"],\"value_required\":true},\"S1\":{\"arity\":1,\"entry\":\"solve\",\"file\":\"program.vscore.json\",\"properties\":[\"typed_total\",\"deterministic\",\"input_preserved\",\"no_external_io\",\"no_floating_point\",\"pure_data\",\"restricted_runtime_only\"],\"value_required\":false}},\"schema_version\":\"0.1\"}", "refs": ["I1", "O1", "O2", "O3", "O4", "O5", "O6", "O7", "S1"]}], "records": [{"id": "D1", "revision": 1, "kind": "entity", "role": "declaration", "statement": "The input is a record containing events, start, end, width and fill. Each event contains a Unicode-scalar string group, mathematical integer time and nullable mathematical integer value. The result is a list of records containing group, start, count and nullable integer value. Define G as the scalar-codepoint lexicographically sorted distinct group names occurring anywhere in events. Define B as the increasing sequence start+k*width for natural k with start+k*width<end. For g in G and b in B, define M(g,b) as the multiset of event occurrences with group=g, non-null value and b<=time<min(b+width,end), n(g,b) as its cardinality, and s(g,b) as the sum of its values.", "required": true, "source_refs": [{"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 239, "interpretation": "Typed JSON representation.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 155}, {"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 393, "interpretation": "Input fields and domains.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 265}, {"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 501, "interpretation": "Group domain.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 394}, {"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 561, "interpretation": "Bucket starts.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 502}, {"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 637, "interpretation": "Bucket intervals.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 562}, {"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 672, "interpretation": "Contributing occurrences.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 638}, {"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 699, "interpretation": "Cardinality.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 673}, {"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 1019, "interpretation": "Result fields.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 957}, {"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 1506, "interpretation": "Integer semantics.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 1435}, {"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 1596, "interpretation": "String semantics.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 1507}], "scope": ["typed input, result and mathematical aggregation definitions"], "dependencies": [], "acceptance_criteria": ["Input and output types represent the specified JSON structures under data-pipeline/0.3.", "Event occurrences retain multiplicity in M.", "Integer domains are unbounded and strings consist of Unicode scalar values."], "origin": "interpreted", "record_digest": "sha256:6664cb9d180bb23a495ff97d13dcb9d4ce509afaf73696260b29354061ec60dd", "blocked_by": []}, {"id": "A1", "revision": 1, "kind": "precondition", "role": "assumption", "statement": "The caller supplies the specified typed input with width a positive integer, start<=end and fill equal to none or previous. No further input bounds or preconditions apply.", "required": true, "source_refs": [{"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 393, "interpretation": "Stated input domain.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 265}, {"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 1687, "interpretation": "No additional assumptions.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 1597}], "scope": ["solve invocation"], "dependencies": [{"id": "D1", "relation": "uses_definition"}], "acceptance_criteria": ["width>0 and start<=end; all fields have the stated domains; no additional restrictions."], "origin": "interpreted", "record_digest": "sha256:f5b7c0102210a52d9aba3f044eaa42d4bb143a5f26ca5ee901fb0b585ea66526", "blocked_by": []}, {"id": "O1", "revision": 1, "kind": "postcondition", "role": "guarantee", "statement": "Deliver canonical program.vscore.json containing exactly one admitted typed entry solve of arity 1, using vscore/0.3 under normative Lean vscore-semantics/0.3 and data-pipeline/0.3. For every input satisfying A1 its typed execution returns the specified JSON result structure. This actual entry must universally refine the complete aggregation specification, be typed total, deterministic, input preserving, free of external I/O and floating point, pure data and restricted-runtime-only.", "required": true, "source_refs": [{"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 154, "interpretation": "Delivery identity.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 79}, {"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 239, "interpretation": "Typed representation.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 155}, {"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 1227, "interpretation": "Normative source and serialization.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 1080}, {"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 1352, "interpretation": "Total pure deterministic execution.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 1294}, {"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 1434, "interpretation": "Input preservation and effects.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 1353}, {"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 1506, "interpretation": "Exact integer arithmetic.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 1435}, {"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 1687, "interpretation": "Complete domain.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 1597}, {"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 5288, "interpretation": "Source delivery for every guarantee.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 5036}, {"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 5458, "interpretation": "No substitution by mathematical existence.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 5289}, {"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 5654, "interpretation": "Universal source refinement.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 5459}, {"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 8118, "interpretation": "O1 source and value facets.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 5957}], "scope": ["delivered source and all specified inputs"], "dependencies": [{"id": "D1", "relation": "uses_definition"}, {"id": "A1", "relation": "assumes"}], "acceptance_criteria": ["Canonical file, entry name, arity, language semantics and serialization profile match the request.", "The admitted entry represents the specified input and output structures and works over the entire stated domain.", "All seven closed source properties hold for solve; result existence or an unrelated entry cannot substitute for implementation refinement."], "origin": "interpreted", "record_digest": "sha256:92d386b99fd7dffb17cf0246da5a656d48b2b8ec6c984fe7187ac8fc3f818810", "blocked_by": []}, {"id": "O2", "revision": 1, "kind": "postcondition", "role": "guarantee", "statement": "For every input satisfying A1, solve uses exactly G: every distinct event group appears once in the group enumeration in Unicode scalar-codepoint lexicographic order, including groups whose events are all outside the requested interval or have null values. This behavior must be universally implemented by program.vscore.json's solve of arity 1 with typed_total, deterministic, input_preserved, no_external_io, no_floating_point, pure_data and restricted_runtime_only.", "required": true, "source_refs": [{"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 501, "interpretation": "Complete sorted distinct group enumeration.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 394}, {"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 1596, "interpretation": "Scalar-codepoint ordering.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 1507}, {"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 5288, "interpretation": "Required canonical source.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 5036}, {"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 5654, "interpretation": "Universal implementation refinement.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 5459}, {"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 8118, "interpretation": "O2 source and value facets.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 5957}], "scope": ["all specified inputs and delivered solve source"], "dependencies": [{"id": "D1", "relation": "uses_definition"}, {"id": "A1", "relation": "assumes"}], "acceptance_criteria": ["Group enumeration equals G without omissions or repetitions.", "Empty events yields an empty group enumeration.", "The actual canonical solve source universally refines this proposition and satisfies all seven source properties."], "origin": "interpreted", "record_digest": "sha256:c2f78f9d695321d44f2a4b569ae7e34ace09a7ff437bec7c217740fd7f64d2ba", "blocked_by": []}, {"id": "O3", "revision": 1, "kind": "postcondition", "role": "guarantee", "statement": "For every input satisfying A1 and every g in G, solve emits exactly one bucket for each b in B, covering [b,min(b+width,end)). There are no other buckets; when start=end there are none. This behavior must be universally implemented by program.vscore.json's solve of arity 1 with typed_total, deterministic, input_preserved, no_external_io, no_floating_point, pure_data and restricted_runtime_only.", "required": true, "source_refs": [{"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 561, "interpretation": "Bucket progression.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 502}, {"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 637, "interpretation": "Strict stopping condition and half-open coverage.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 562}, {"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 5288, "interpretation": "Required canonical source.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 5036}, {"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 5654, "interpretation": "Universal implementation refinement.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 5459}, {"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 8118, "interpretation": "O3 source and value facets.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 5957}], "scope": ["all groups, all specified intervals and delivered source"], "dependencies": [{"id": "D1", "relation": "uses_definition"}, {"id": "A1", "relation": "assumes"}], "acceptance_criteria": ["Bucket starts are exactly start+k*width<end for natural k.", "Intervals include their lower endpoint and exclude their upper endpoint, truncating the last interval at end.", "The actual canonical solve source universally refines this proposition and satisfies all seven source properties."], "origin": "interpreted", "record_digest": "sha256:d3ab3e2f0be74d11a5cf09bdd648a848fc4da29b7a8b0a5f457fddd263cdb94a", "blocked_by": []}, {"id": "O4", "revision": 1, "kind": "postcondition", "role": "guarantee", "statement": "For every input satisfying A1 and each emitted pair (g,b), count=n(g,b) and the bucket sum=s(g,b), computed using exact unbounded mathematical integers. Only non-null values of occurrences in that group's half-open bucket interval contribute; every duplicate occurrence contributes separately. This behavior must be universally implemented by program.vscore.json's solve of arity 1 with typed_total, deterministic, input_preserved, no_external_io, no_floating_point, pure_data and restricted_runtime_only.", "required": true, "source_refs": [{"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 672, "interpretation": "Non-null in-range aggregation.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 638}, {"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 699, "interpretation": "Count of contributing occurrences.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 673}, {"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 1078, "interpretation": "Duplicate multiplicity.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 1020}, {"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 1506, "interpretation": "Exact unbounded integer sums.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 1435}, {"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 5288, "interpretation": "Required canonical source.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 5036}, {"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 5654, "interpretation": "Universal implementation refinement.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 5459}, {"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 8118, "interpretation": "O4 source and value facets.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 5957}], "scope": ["every emitted bucket and delivered source"], "dependencies": [{"id": "D1", "relation": "uses_definition"}, {"id": "A1", "relation": "assumes"}], "acceptance_criteria": ["Count equals the cardinality of M(g,b), including duplicate occurrences.", "Sum equals the mathematical sum over M(g,b); null and out-of-range values contribute neither count nor sum.", "The actual canonical solve source universally refines this proposition and satisfies all seven source properties."], "origin": "interpreted", "record_digest": "sha256:f0d3a60f336821a14007dfd08109b09810870eb7c6c6648aa66241a64ca6e29a", "blocked_by": []}, {"id": "O5", "revision": 1, "kind": "postcondition", "role": "guarantee", "statement": "For every specified input and pair (g,b), if n(g,b)>0 the returned value is s(g,b). If n(g,b)=0 and fill=none the value is null. If n(g,b)=0 and fill=previous the value is s(g,b') for the greatest earlier b' in B with n(g,b')>0, or null if no such b' exists. Previous state is independent per group, starts absent, is updated only by nonempty buckets, is never reset by empty buckets, treats zero sums as present values, and never receives values from events before start. This complete causal formula must be universally implemented by program.vscore.json's solve of arity 1 with typed_total, deterministic, input_preserved, no_external_io, no_floating_point, pure_data and restricted_runtime_only.", "required": true, "source_refs": [{"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 759, "interpretation": "Nonempty value and update.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 700}, {"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 879, "interpretation": "Both empty-bucket fill branches and initial null.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 760}, {"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 915, "interpretation": "Empty buckets preserve previous state.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 880}, {"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 956, "interpretation": "No pre-start seeding.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 916}, {"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 1078, "interpretation": "Zero is a present previous value.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 1020}, {"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 5288, "interpretation": "Required canonical source.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 5036}, {"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 5654, "interpretation": "Universal implementation refinement.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 5459}, {"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 8118, "interpretation": "O5 source and value facets.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 5957}], "scope": ["all groups, both fill modes, all buckets and delivered source"], "dependencies": [{"id": "D1", "relation": "uses_definition"}, {"id": "A1", "relation": "assumes"}], "acceptance_criteria": ["Nonempty means positive count of non-null contributing occurrences, including buckets whose sum is zero.", "Every returned value follows the stated three branches.", "Prior state is the latest strictly earlier nonempty bucket sum in the same group, with no pre-start seed or empty-bucket reset.", "The actual canonical solve source universally refines this proposition and satisfies all seven source properties."], "origin": "interpreted", "record_digest": "sha256:29c1a5f53fef1d7f425297e0144f8cfa1ea1a152f7295dbfbdee5220c67c1481", "blocked_by": []}, {"id": "O6", "revision": 1, "kind": "postcondition", "role": "guarantee", "statement": "For every input satisfying A1, solve returns exactly the list of records {group:g,start:b,count:n(g,b),value:v(g,b)}, where v follows O5, enumerating g through G and b through B in that order. Preserve the exact specified JSON field structure and list ordering under data-pipeline/0.3. This behavior must be universally implemented by program.vscore.json's solve of arity 1 with typed_total, deterministic, input_preserved, no_external_io, no_floating_point, pure_data and restricted_runtime_only.", "required": true, "source_refs": [{"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 1019, "interpretation": "Result structure and order.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 957}, {"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 1227, "interpretation": "Serialization profile.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 1080}, {"document_hash": "sha256:789cb596e5b534eacc67b4942a06050b87af78619d904ab1a54e340d977799f2", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-012:D21", "end_byte": 1293, "interpretation": "Exact structure and ordering preservation.", "o